SUMMARY:Objects of Memory
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261130T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261130T203000
UID:evt-VHcH1buewZDeWZJ@events.lu.ma
DESCRIPTION:Address:\n205 Richmond St W\nRHA 120 (1st Floor OCAD Universit
 y)\nToronto\, ON\nCanada\n\nBring an object\, share a story. A workshop fo
 r holding loss together.\nBring a photograph\, heirloom\, or object "touch
 stone" connected to a loss. Loss is defined by many experiences\, from peo
 ple to animals\, from places and lives lived that have been left behind.\n
 Through guided prompt cards\, we’ll map the unwritten stories held withi
 n our physical keepsakes. Join us for a creative storytelling experience d
 esigned to shift loss into shared\, community care.\n\nHosted by Victoria 
 Lynda Stacey
LOCATION:205 Richmond St W\, Toronto\, ON M5V 3Y8\, Canada
